            <div style="line-height: 1.25; font-weight: bold;">Management&#8217;s Discussion and Analysis</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="line-height: 1.25;">REVENUES AND GROSS MARGINS</div>
      <div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>
      <div style="line-height: 1.25;">REVENUES</div>
      <div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>
      <div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25;">
        <div style="line-height: 1.25;">The revenues of the Group are primarily generated from sales of medical cannabis products to customers in Israel and Germany. The reportable geographical segments in which the Company operates are Israel and Germany.</div>
        <div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>
      </div>
      <div style="line-height: 1.25;">For the three months ended March 31:</div>
      <div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>
      <div style="line-height: 1.25"> </div>
