      <div style="line-height: 1.25">
        <div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25;">* See Note 1 under <font style="font-style: italic;">&#8220;Review of Financial Performance &#8211; Financial Highlights&#8221;</font> section of the MD&amp;A.</div>
