      <div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25;">
        <div style="line-height: 1.25;">The Company&#8217;s Adjusted EBITDA loss for the three months ended March 31, 2024, was increased, primarily due to, savings in the Company&#8217;s general and administrative expenses such as insurance cost reduction, cost
          efficiencies from synergies and other corporate expenses reduction.</div>
