            </td>
            <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top;">&#9679;</td>
            <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
              <div>the competitive conditions of the industry will be unfavourable to the Company, and the Company&#8217;s inability to maintain or grow its market share and maintain its competitive advantages;</div>
            </td>
          </tr>

      </table>
      <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;" class="DSPFListTable" id="zc90759048a8e4bb8b1ed1f9a1e8234a5">

